  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are immune to the Poisoned condition, and you have Resistance to a damage type associated with your current land choice in the Circle Spells feature, as shown in the Nature's Ward table.</p><table><caption>Nature's Ward</caption><thead><tr><td>Land Type</td><td>Resistance</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Arid</td><td>Fire</td></tr><tr><td>Polar</td><td>Cold</td></tr><tr><td>Temperate</td><td>Lightning</td></tr><tr><td>Tropical</td><td>Poison</td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>Automation:</strong> the Poisoned immunity is always on. When you choose your land after a Long Rest, use that land's activity: it gives the matching Resistance, replacing the previous land's.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
